# Swift Package Manager metadata (leave sources tracked)
# Packages/
# Derived here, not the source of truth. Package.swift returns two different packages (Lite by
# default, the full app under CODEXBAR_FULL=1) while SwiftPM keeps a single lockfile slot, and it
# discards a Package.resolved whose originHash does not match the manifest being evaluated. Full
# build versions are therefore pinned exactly in Package.swift instead.
Package.resolved
